<main id="main" class="page-top">

  <section class="band on-brown" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Persian, Afghan and South Asian weddings · San Francisco Bay Area</p>
      <div class="band__title">
        <h1 id="page-title" class="h-display">Weddings</h1>
        <p class="fa fa--title" lang="fa" dir="rtl">عروسی</p>
      </div>
      <hr class="rule" style="margin:32px 0 24px">
      <p class="lede measure">Our celebrations are built on centuries of poetry, hospitality and sacred tradition, and they deserve more than a cookie-cutter approach. We honor the deep soul of your heritage while stripping away the stress and the outdated tropes.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sofreh Aghd -->
  <section class="section tradition" id="sofreh-aghd" aria-labelledby="t-sofreh">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="tradition__grid">
        <div class="tradition__text">
          <div class="tradition__title reveal">
            <h2 id="t-sofreh">Sofreh Aghd</h2>
            <p class="fa fa--big" lang="fa" dir="rtl">سفرهٔ عقد</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stagger">
            <p>The spread at the head of the room: mirror, candlesticks, honey, bread, coins, the pomegranate.</p>
            <p>We design an architectural, modern sofreh and lay it exactly as your family keeps it.</p>
            <p>Every item is named in both languages, so guests from the other family learn each one at a glance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="tradition__media reveal">
          <div class="window"><img class="reveal-img" src="assets/img/pom-open-closeup.jpg" width="2000" height="1123" alt="An opened pomegranate, seeds packed tight" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <figcaption class="caption">The sofreh is ready. Your grandparents are seated.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Nikah -->
  <section class="section tradition tradition--flip" id="nikah" aria-labelledby="t-nikah">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="tradition__grid">
        <div class="tradition__text">
          <div class="tradition__title reveal">
            <h2 id="t-nikah">Nikah</h2>
            <p class="fa fa--big" lang="fa" dir="rtl">نکاح</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stagger">
            <p>The marriage contract, read before witnesses and both families.</p>
            <p>We cue the officiant and the family, hold the elders' seats, and keep the room quiet and steady.</p>
            <p>A one-line programme explains the ritual, so every guest can follow.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="tradition__media reveal">
          <div class="window"><img class="reveal-img" src="assets/img/pom-in-hand.jpg" width="1500" height="2000" alt="A pomegranate held in an open hand" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <figcaption class="caption">Quiet, exact, unhurried.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mehndi & Sangeet -->
  <section class="section tradition" id="mehndi-sangeet" aria-labelledby="t-mehndi">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="tradition__grid">
        <div class="tradition__text">
          <div class="tradition__title reveal">
            <h2 id="t-mehndi">Mehndi &amp; Sangeet</h2>
            <p class="fa fa--big" lang="fa" dir="rtl">حنابندان</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stagger">
            <p>The henna night: music, dance and henna on the bride's hands.</p>
            <p>The sangeet, where both families sing and dance, and the baraat that arrives with music.</p>
            <p>High energy, run to the minute, with the elders' blessing first.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="tradition__media reveal">
          <div class="window"><img class="reveal-img" src="assets/img/pom-pile.jpg" width="1411" height="2000" alt="A pile of pomegranates" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <figcaption class="caption">Both families, one dance floor.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Reception & Walima -->
  <section class="section tradition tradition--flip" id="reception-walima" aria-labelledby="t-reception">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="tradition__grid">
        <div class="tradition__text">
          <div class="tradition__title reveal">
            <h2 id="t-reception">Reception &amp; Walima</h2>
            <p class="fa fa--big" lang="fa" dir="rtl">جشن عروسی · ولیمه</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stagger">
            <p>Welcome sign, seating, menu and table numbers in both digit sets.</p>
            <p>The timeline called with the venue and every vendor, from the first dance to the 2 AM dance floor.</p>
            <p>A favour box for each family at the send-off, and a thank-you card that follows.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="tradition__media reveal">
          <div class="window"><img class="reveal-img" src="assets/img/pom-tree-night.jpg" width="1125" height="2000" alt="A pomegranate tree at night" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <figcaption class="caption">From the sacred vows to the last song.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Seasonal note -->
  <section class="section section--tight tradition" id="seasons" aria-labelledby="t-seasons">
    <div class="container container--text">
      <div class="seasonal reveal">
        <div class="tradition__title">
          <h2 id="t-seasons">Nowruz &amp; Yalda</h2>
          <p class="fa fa--big" lang="fa" dir="rtl">نوروز · شب یلدا</p>
        </div>
        <p>Spring, and the longest night. If your date falls near Nowruz or Shab-e Yalda, we fold the haft-sin or the pomegranate table into the celebration, in the season's own colours.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">Two heritages at one table? We blend cultures across a multi-day celebration without diluting either.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta on-brown" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="cta-title" class="cta__title reveal">Reimagined Heritage</h2>
      <p class="fa fa--big reveal" lang="fa" dir="rtl" style="text-align:center">میراث، از نو</p>
      <p class="reveal"><a class="btn btn--amber" href="index.html#inquire">Inquire</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

